@startuml
|Secretary|
start
:Register student;
:Record intake;
:Add guardians;
:Enroll in program;

|School Coordinator|
:Track academics & attendance;

if (Drop or Complete?) then (Yes)
  :Request status change;
  |Program Coordinator|
  :Review drop request;
  |Director|
  :Approve or reject;
  stop
else (No)
  |Program Coordinator|
  if (Transition needed?) then (Yes)
    :Request program change;
    |Director|
    :Approve or reject;
  endif
  stop
endif
@enduml
